/**
 * Pure structural comparator for the parity harness.
 *
 * A capture is a flat, typed list of text and control nodes. The harness adapter
 * owns the actual DOM/text/control walk and the computed-style property list.
 * This module performs no DOM access, I/O, hashing, or screenshot work.
