 * Input array order is not semantic.
 *
 * Computed styles are canonicalized by property name. Repeated style keys are
 * invalid; such a capture produces only `invalid_capture` findings. Geometry
 * tolerance defaults to zero; there is no implicit pixel safety mask.
 *
